  "fields": {
    "name": "ShardSetsBase<TConfiguration>.ShardSet collection and shard-selection interface",
    "kind": "Library",
    "language": "text",
    "contract": "ShardSetsBase<TConfiguration>.ShardSet represents one configured shard set. Construction establishes the collection of configured ShardInstance<TConfiguration> values and exposes ReadAll, ReadFirst, and Write operation surfaces. Callers can retrieve a member by its short shard identifier or by an IShardKey's ShardId; Count reports the member count; DefaultShard returns the configured default member; CopyTo and GetEnumerator expose the member collection; IsSynchronized reports true and SyncRoot supplies the collection's synchronization object."
  },
